    "name": "Prime Numbers & Tricks to find",
    "description": "PRIME NUMBER TRICK\n\n1. √N nikalo.\n\n2. √N tak ke prime numbers se divide karo.\n\n3. Agar divide ho jaye\n   ⇒ Prime nahi\n\n4. Agar divide na ho\n   ⇒ Prime hai\n\n\nEXAMPLE:\n91\n\n√91 ≈ 9\n\nCheck:\n2, 3, 5, 7\n\n91 ÷ 7 = 13\n⇒ 91 Prime nahi hai\n\n\nCONCLUSION:\nPrime number sirf 1 aur khud se divide hota hai.",
